{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isometric insurgency simulator. Fight on foot and in vehicles, build and steal a private arsenal and kill some rich pricks who ruined it for the rest of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is a down and out nobody thrust into the violent underbelly of the SNC homeworld after corrupt cops are set upon you, and the only path forward is to meet the violence head on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get around Mar Nosso on foot, or go loud against local forces with your own armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire and fire</strong> 30+ weapons, from Nossian Corvid zipguns to the latest in man-portable Spacer tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around\u00a0<strong>rich detailed sprite environments </strong>in vehicles like clapped-out sedans, tanks or bipedal mechs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an original soundtrack scored by acclaimed musician\u00a0<strong>Makeup And Vanity Set</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disrupt the corporate control of Mar Nosso by <strong>killing Brigadors</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brigador Killers is in active development and coming to a Steam store near you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/903930?t=1775147755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/90426b49254d37c3ff35af05e3a70a8021d70f9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775147755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/82917d7834a73d52595aa95d5fe8fc72ace97ba6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775147755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/82917d7834a73d52595aa95d5fe8fc72ace97ba6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775147755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players can cause destruction across numerous levels both on foot and in a vehicle. Most combat is with other hostile NPCs and vehicles, but both hostile and non-hostile human-scale characters can be encountered and subsequently crushed by the player. Blood splats that human-scale characters leave behind can be turned off by toggling the DISABLE GRAPHIC CONTENT option in SETTINGS > GENERAL. \r\n\r\nIn-game text entries may not be fit for those under the age of 16, as some contain descriptions of violent acts, crude humor and horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isometric insurgency simulator. Fight on foot and in vehicles, build and steal a private arsenal and kill some rich pricks who ruined it for the rest of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/566f829c485cd28cea7d241e6de811c8.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is a down and out nobody thrust into the violent underbelly of the SNC homeworld after corrupt cops are set upon you, and the only path forward is to meet the violence head on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a47343a816abed98baf6a748b110a881.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get around Mar Nosso on foot, or go loud against local forces with your own armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.poster.avif?t=1775147755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.webm?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/d3a638d6acbc837c82b0a005ac4c10b6.mp4?t=1775147755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire and fire</strong> 30+ weapons, from Nossian Corvid zipguns to the latest in man-portable Spacer tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around\u00a0<strong>rich detailed sprite environments </strong>in vehicles like clapped-out sedans, tanks or bipedal mechs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an original soundtrack scored by acclaimed musician\u00a0<strong>Makeup And Vanity Set</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disrupt the corporate control of Mar Nosso by <strong>killing Brigadors</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brigador Killers is in active development and coming to a Steam store near you.</p>","developers":["Stellar Jockeys","Gausswerks"],"genres":[{"description"